# fixture: annual-trueup-from-brokerage  (adversarial)
#
# THE LAST THING THE RUN DOES. chronometer_run calls applyYear after
# monthlyChron, so the annual tax true-up emits past the reconciliation scan
# index; the final year has no next month to catch it. This plan ends in
# December AND settles a real residual from a brokerage, so the trailing
# pass sees both a taxTrueUp and a capitalGainRecognized. Without a fixture
# that reaches it, Portfolio.finalSanityCheck could be deleted with the
# whole suite green (verified by mutation 2026-08-05).

